versions.tr:
PECUNIARY COMPENSATION IS NOT DUE where:
the airline can prove that the cancellation was caused by exceptional circumstances, for example adverse weather, security alarms or strikes;
the passenger was informed of the cancellation:
with at least two weeks' notice;
between two weeks and seven days before departure and an alternative flight is offered departing no more than two hours before the originally planned time and arriving at the final destination at most four hours after the originally planned time;
less than seven days before departure and an alternative flight is offered departing no more than one hour before the originally planned time and arriving at the final destination at most two hours after the originally planned time.

airlines-tap-air-portugal-mvp-cancellati.quote:
1.4) The passengers are entitled to the following compensation, paid following the provisions of paragraph a. of 1.1) above:
• 250 euros for all flights up to 1 500 kilometers;
• 400 euros for all intra-Community flights above 1 50 kilometers and all flights from 1 500 to 3 500 kilometers;
• 600 euros for all flights not covered in paragraphs a. or b.
Note: We use the passenger's last destination, on which, due to cancellation, the arrival will be affected, as a base to determine the corresponding distance. Distances must be measured using the great circle route method.
Except for:
• The passenger received the cancellation notice at least two weeks to seven days before the scheduled departure time;
• The passenger received the cancellation notice at least two weeks to seven days before the scheduled departure time. Rerouting was provided, allowing the passenger to leave up to two hours earlier than the scheduled departure time and arrive at the final destination up to four hours later than the original arrival time;
• The passenger received the cancellation notice less than seven days before the scheduled departure time. Rerouting was provided, allowing the passenger to leave up to one hour before the scheduled departure time and arrive at the final destination up to two hours after the scheduled departure time;
• TAP Air Portugal can demonstrate that the cancellation was caused by unavoidable, extraordinary circumstances, even if deploying all reasonable measures.

