• No criminal convictions;
• German language skills of at least B1 under the Common European Framework of Reference; and
• Knowledge of Germany’s legal and social order and living conditions.

Participants in full-time courses additionally receive a monthly subsistence contribution. Its amount depends on your income and assets and on your spouse’s or registered partner’s income:
